Namespaces	Global naming system
Metadata	Shared metadata model
Types	Common type system
References	Object reference model
Time	Temporal semantics
Versioning	Shared version semantics
Serialization	Common exchange formats
Extensions	Extension framework
Packaging	Artifact packaging
Security	Shared technical security
Localization	Internationalization support
Vocabulary	Shared terminology
Interoperability	Cross-system exchange
Conformance	Foundation certification

Subsequent AFS specifications SHALL define each service normatively.

